  "description": "A .NET library for converting numbers to words with multi-language and multi-currency support.\n\n- Languages: English, Turkish, French, Spanish, Portuguese\n- Multi-currency, with per-locale currency maps and custom currency overrides\n- Irregular number handling: teens, vigesimal forms, apocope, plural scale words\n- Culture-based conversion from a culture code or CultureInfo\n- Fully extensible through JSON or a localization model you build yourself\n- Immutable, thread-safe converters with cached localization parsing",
